      "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The skreesire is in rocky terrain</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Until the next time they act, the skreesire resembles rocky terrain. They have an automatic result of 29 on deception checks and DCs to pass as rocky terrain.</p>",
