      "traits": [
        "concentrate",
        "mental",
        "primal"
      ],
      "description": "<p><strong>Effect</strong> A target within 30 feet hears a telepathic manifestation of the skreesire's will and must attempt a DC 22 Will Saving Throw save.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature must use the first action of its next turn to Stride toward the skreesire.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature must use all its actions on its next turn to Stride toward the skreesire; when it's adjacent to the skreesire, it drops Prone and ends its turn.</p>",
